  "worked_solution": "Given a function in the form $f(x)=A\\operatorname{sin}\u2061(Bx+C)+D,$ the period $T$ is given by $\\frac{2\\pi }{B}.$\n\nIn our case, we have that $B=\\frac{5}{3}.$ Therefore, the period is $\\frac{2\\pi }{(\\frac{5}{3})}=\\frac{6\\pi }{5}.$",
